    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55748" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατελπ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hope</i> or <i>expect confidently</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. εὐπετέως τῆς θαλάσσης κρατήσειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.136
				</span></i>
