			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>: c. gen., <i>base</i> one's <i>hopes upon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς αὐτῶν δυνάμεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					5.1.20
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποβαίνειν οἷα κατηλπίσθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
